%S A401794 1,15,94,293,742,1642,3463,7095,14515,29813,61768,128786,269852,
%T A401794 566863,1191945,2505501,5261285,11032122,23094926,48265375,100699350,
%U A401794 209756925,436255643,906024538,1879110579,3892384607,8053143032,16643087125,34359837504,70867070498
%N A401794 Number of nonempty convex vertex sets in the n X n queen graph.
%C A401794 All cliques are convex vertex sets. The remaining sets have diameter 2 and consist of a maximal array of equally spaced vertices in the n X n grid with the horizontal and vertical distance between nearest vertices being the same odd integer. By maximal it is meant that the set of chosen grid vertices is extended as far as possible horizontally and vertically. There must be at least 2 X 3 or 3 X 2 vertices for such a set to not also be a clique.
%H A401794 Andrew Howroyd, <a href="/A401794/b401794.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..1000</a>
%H A401794 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/QueenGraph.html">Queen Graph</a>.
%H A401794 <a href="/index/Rec#order_16">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (6,-14,18,-16,6,11,-24,31,-30,20,-6,-10,18,-17,12,-4).
%F A401794 G.f.: x*(1 + 9*x + 18*x^2 - 79*x^3 + 46*x^4 - 166*x^5 + 128*x^6 - 68*x^7 + 280*x^8 + 137*x^9 + 332*x^10 + 221*x^11 + 247*x^12 + 110*x^13 + 84*x^14)/((1 - x)^4*(1 + x)^2*(1 - 2*x)^2*(1 - x + x^2)*(1 + x^2)^2*(1 + x + x^2)).
%e A401794 For n = 7, there are 6 convex vertex sets that are not cliques, illustrated below:
%e A401794   xxxxxxx  x..x..x  .x..x..  ..x..x.  .......  .......
%e A401794   xxxxxxx  .......  .......  .......  x..x..x  .......
%e A401794   xxxxxxx  .......  .......  .......  .......  x..x..x
%e A401794   xxxxxxx  x..x..x  .x..x..  ..x..x.  .......  .......
%e A401794   xxxxxxx  .......  .......  .......  x..x..x  .......
%e A401794   xxxxxxx  .......  .......  .......  .......  x..x..x
%e A401794   xxxxxxx  x..x..x  .x..x..  ..x..x.  .......  .......
%o A401794 (PARI) \\ c(n) is A295903(n)-1, b(n) is number that are not cliques.
%o A401794 b(n) = {sum(k=1, (n-1)\2, if(k%2, k^2 - max(0,3*k-n)^2))}
%o A401794 c(n) = { 3*2^(n + 1) + n*((-1)^(n + 1) + 2^(n + 2) + n*(9*n - 26) - 2)/2 - 6 }
%o A401794 a(n) = { c(n) + b(n) }
%Y A401794 Cf. A295903 (cliques), A401793 (in king graph), A401285, A401286.
%K A401794 nonn,easy,new
%O A401794 1,2
